{"path":"string/char_traits/find","title":"std::char_traits<char>::find, std::char_traits<wchar_t>::find, std::char_traits<char8_t>::find, std::char_traits<char16_t>::find, std::char_traits<char32_t>::find","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;char&gt;::</span>find, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;wchar_t&gt;::</span>find, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;char8_t&gt;::</span>find, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;char16_t&gt;::</span>find, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::char_traits&lt;char32_t&gt;::</span>find","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/char_traits/find","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Searches for character ch within the first count characters of the sequence pointed to by ptr.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> char_type<span class=\"sy2\">*</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; find<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> char_type<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> ptr, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> count, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> char_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ch <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Searches for character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> within the first <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code> characters of the sequence pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ptr</span></code>.\n</p><p>See <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/CharTraits\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">CharTraits</em></a> for the general requirements on character traits for <code>X::find</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ptr\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to a character string to search\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> count\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the number of characters to analyze\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the character to search for\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A pointer to the first character in the range specified by <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ptr</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ptr <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> count</span></code><code>)</code></span> that compares equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code>, or a null pointer if not found.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code>.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/char_traits","title":"std::char_traits"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::char_traits<char>::find, std::char_traits<wchar_t>::find, std::char_traits<char8_t>::find, std::char_traits<char16_t>::find, std::char_traits<char32_t>::find","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Searches for character ch within the first count characters of the sequence pointed to by ptr."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ptr, count, ch"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A pointer to the first character in the range specified by [ptr, ptr + count) that compares equal to ch, or a null pointer if not found."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Linear in count."}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":101,"codeBlockCount":0}
